-atp-beijing-djokovic</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.benrothenberg.com/p/daniil-medvedev-default-disqualification-rule-atp-beijing-djokovic</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Ben Rothenberg]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 01:57:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kGWo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2e6f00e-22f5-40c4-803b-4220acf484dc_800x450.gif" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>After a career of much mayhem-making, the way that Daniil Medvedev finally caught his first tour-level default on Monday in Beijing felt a bit like the feds finally bringing down Al Capone for tax evasion.</p><p><em><strong>To read a deep dive into the rules&#8212;or lack thereof&#8212;that Medvedev broke, please subscribe to </strong></em><strong>Bounces</strong><em><strong>! &#8212;Ben</strong></em></p>
